<view class="login-page">
  <app-header title="重庆天才" show-back="{{false}}" />
  <view wx:if="{{isBlocked}}" class="login-body blocked-card">
    <view class="login-title">暂时无法进入</view><view class="login-description">{{message}}</view>
    <t-button theme="primary" variant="outline" bindtap="backToLaunch" block custom-style="min-height:48px;">返回首页</t-button>
  </view>
  <block wx:else>
    <view class="login-hero"><image class="login-hero__photo" src="/assets/content/football-editorial.jpg" mode="aspectFill" /><view class="login-hero__scrim" /><view class="login-hero__copy"><view class="login-hero__title"><view>重庆天才</view><view>足球俱乐部</view></view><view class="login-hero__caption">把热爱，留在球场</view></view></view>
    <view class="login-body">
      <view class="login-title">欢迎回到球队</view>
      <view class="login-description">使用微信手机号匹配俱乐部档案，进入你的专属服务。</view>
      <view class="agreement-row"><t-checkbox class="agreement-check" checked="{{agreementAccepted}}" disabled="{{submitting}}" content="" aria-label="同意用户协议和隐私政策" bindchange="onAgreementChange" /><view class="agreement-copy"><text bindtap="toggleAgreement">我已阅读并同意</text><text class="agreement-link" catchtap="openAgreement">《用户协议》</text><text>和</text><text class="agreement-link" catchtap="openPrivacy">《隐私政策》</text></view></view>
      <button class="login-cta {{!agreementAccepted || submitting || state === 'loading' || authorizationLocked ? 'login-cta--disabled' : ''}}" open-type="getPhoneNumber|agreePrivacyAuthorization" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{!agreementAccepted || submitting || state === 'loading' || authorizationLocked}}" bindtap="onPhoneAuthorizationTap" bindgetphonenumber="onGetPhoneNumber" bindagreeprivacyauthorization="onPrivacyAgreed">微信手机号登录</button>
      <view wx:if="{{state === 'loading'}}" class="login-feedback" aria-live="polite">{{message}}</view>
      <view wx:elif="{{state === 'error' || state === 'pending'}}" class="login-feedback login-feedback--error" aria-live="polite">{{message}}<t-button theme="primary" variant="text" bindtap="retry" custom-style="min-height:44px;">重新尝试</t-button></view>
      <view class="login-caption">身份由俱乐部配置；拥有多个身份时，可在“我的”中切换。</view>
    </view>
  </block>
  <t-popup visible="{{agreementVisible}}" placement="bottom" bindclose="closeAgreement" safe-area-inset-bottom>
    <view class="agreement-panel"><view class="login-title">用户协议</view><scroll-view scroll-y class="agreement-document"><view>本小程序提供重庆天才足球俱乐部的日程、训练、测评和球队服务。</view><view>请使用与俱乐部登记资料一致的微信手机号登录。可访问的身份、球队和孩子由俱乐部授权配置；资料不一致时请联系俱乐部管理员更正。</view><view>家长可查看自己监护授权内的孩子信息；教练可在授权球队范围内使用相关服务。测评结果以俱乐部确认后的记录为准。</view><view>请妥善保管微信账号，仅在授权范围内查看和使用相关信息。如需更正资料或申请注销，请通过“我的”中的账号设置联系俱乐部处理。</view><view>个人信息处理范围及方式，以微信展示的《小程序用户隐私保护指引》为准。点击隐私政策可打开原文；勾选本页协议不会代替微信平台的隐私授权。</view></scroll-view><t-button theme="primary" variant="outline" block bindtap="closeAgreement" custom-style="min-height:48px;">关闭</t-button></view>
  </t-popup>
</view>
